      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "4. Poach haddock in a little white wine and fish stock."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "5. Reduce rest of fish stock with cream, add watercress and blend till smooth texture."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "6.  Put risotto mixture in centre of plate, place poached haddock on top and pour sauce around it."
